# PLAN-1078 — 普通 AV 语言基线：表达式与短路（语言共享语料第一份）

The first canonical file of the feature-organized language corpus. Every
case carries ONE Auto source; AV / AC-native / legacy-reference checks share
the same source bytes and record their own real results. The `av` check runs
the ordinary AV language chain (`ac-av/language-source-run-v1`, Auto profile);
it never falls back to the old VM.

## Case: baseline-value
id: "av.parity.1078.baseline-value"
tags: ["av-language-parity", "plan-1078", "basics"]
links: ["PLAN-1078", "PLAN-1002"]
entry-mode: "program"

### Auto
path: "main.at"

```auto
fn main() int { return 2 + 3 * 4 }
```

### Probe av
recipe: "ac-av/language-source-run-v1"
